        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, borehole heat exchanger, at brine-water heat pump 10kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, borehole heat exchanger, at brine-water heat pump 10kW
Heat at heat pump without heat distribution.;
UUID: c5145e64-c144-3075-84ed-736c6ddef027
Includes infrastucture and electricity (electricity mix UCTE) for heat pump. Includes emissions of refrigerant (R134a) during operation. Heat at heat pump, i.e. heat distribution in the house is not included.
Location: Conditions of operation extrapolated from Switzerland to RER. Operation with UCTE electricity mix.
Technology: Based on average SPF2 (Seasonal Performance Factor, including auxiliary energy) of brine-water heat pumps installed in year 1998 operating in Switzerland.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c5145e64-c144-3075-84ed-736c6ddef027.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
